    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dare to travel back 40,000 years and help the caveman escape extinction in this challenging platforming adventure across three unique worlds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a tough challenge in the prehistoric era! Test your skills by jumping your way up to the top, where a frozen cavewoman awaits your rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/6da855fbf9d5fe2a2e90b2ab4cd863d6.poster.avif?t=1755247002\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/6da855fbf9d5fe2a2e90b2ab4cd863d6.webm?t=1755247002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/6da855fbf9d5fe2a2e90b2ab4cd863d6.mp4?t=1755247002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Action-packed platforming adventure!</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>3 unique worlds</strong> with beautifully crafted environments!<br>\u2022 <strong>Help the caveman survive extinction!</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Custom artwork and a distinctive design!</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Reach the top \u2014 if you're skilled enough!</strong> <br>\u2022 <strong>Time your jumps carefully\u2026 or fall into the void!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/aba4c3ee2f82d3dfd015299ff11ca0a1.poster.avif?t=1755247002\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/aba4c3ee2f82d3dfd015299ff11ca0a1.webm?t=1755247002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579360/extras/aba4c3ee2f82d3dfd015299ff11ca0a1.mp4?t=1755247002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
